  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Crazed Demon Cave, Pang Shan says Care Immortal Gu alone is not enough. Not Immortal takes out Immortal Gu No. The two Immortal Gu float toward Fang Yuan with wills and red date immortal essence for Domination Immortal Chu Du. Care and No are the two rank seven Immortal Gu lent out this way.",
